💻💻💻 Database Schema
This project is based on the following four tables:

🤵🏾🤵🏾🤵🏾 1. farmers
Contains farmer details.

| Column Name | Data Type | Description |
|------------|-----------|-------------|
| farmer_id | INT | Unique farmer ID |
| first_name | VARCHAR | Farmer first name |
| last_name | VARCHAR | Farmer last name |
| email | VARCHAR | Farmer email |
| hire_date | DATE | Hiring date |

🔆🔆🔆2. plots
Contains agricultural plot details.

| Column Name | Data Type | Description |
|------------|-----------|-------------|
| plot_id | INT | Unique plot ID |
| plot_name | VARCHAR | Plot name |
| farmer_id | INT | Farmer managing the plot |
| crop_type | VARCHAR | Type of crop |
| soil_type | VARCHAR | Soil type |

☸️☸️3. yields
Contains harvest and yield records.

| Column Name | Data Type | Description |
|------------|-----------|-------------|
| yield_id | INT | Unique yield record ID |
| plot_id | INT | Plot ID |
| harvest_date | DATE | Harvest date |
| yield_kg | DECIMAL | Yield in kilograms |
| weather_condition | VARCHAR | Weather condition |

📍📍 4. irrigation_logs
Contains irrigation details.

| Column Name | Data Type | Description |
|------------|-----------|-------------|
| log_id | INT | Unique irrigation log ID |
| plot_id | INT | Plot ID |
| irrigation_date | DATE | Irrigation date |
| water_amount_liters | DECIMAL | Water used in liters |

